; FileCheck spec for atomic_store_runtime_ord.logos — T2-24.
; Runtime Ordering → branch on SeqCst(4); SeqCst path stores seq_cst, the
; other stores release (a plain `mov` on x86, avoiding the seq_cst `xchg`).

; CHECK-LABEL: define {{.*}}my_rt_store
; CHECK: icmp eq i32 {{.*}}, 4
; CHECK-DAG: store atomic i64 {{.*}} seq_cst
; CHECK-DAG: store atomic i64 {{.*}} release
